                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM 1245-EDIT-NUM-REQD THRU 1245-EDIT-NUM-REQD-EXIT
            EXPECT WS-EDIT-ALPHANUM-ONLY-FLAGS TO BE 'B'
            VERIFY CALL 'DFHEI1' HAPPENED 0 TIMES

