      ******************************************************************
      *  TC15 -- 1270-EDIT-US-STATE-CD rejects unknown state code
      *
      *  Drives 1270-EDIT-US-STATE-CD with an obviously-invalid
      *  2-letter state code 'ZZ'.  Production looks up the code in
      *  the US-STATE-CODE table embedded in CSLKPCDY copybook; if
      *  not found, sets FLG-STATE-NOT-OK and populates the message.
      *  Asserts side effect on the validation flag.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'COACTUPC 1270-EDIT-US-STATE-CD rejects unknown ZZ'
            MOVE 'ZZ' TO ACUP-NEW-CUST-ADDR-STATE-CD
            MOVE 'StateCd' TO WS-EDIT-VARIABLE-NAME
            MOCK CALL 'DFHEI1'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM 1270-EDIT-US-STATE-CD THRU 1270-EDIT-US-STATE-CD-EXIT
            EXPECT WS-EDIT-STATE-FLGS TO BE '0'
            VERIFY CALL 'DFHEI1' HAPPENED 0 TIMES

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC16 -- 3201-SHOW-INITIAL-VALUES blanks out screen fields
      *
      *  Drives 3201-SHOW-INITIAL-VALUES which initializes the
      *  output map fields (ACSTTUSO, ACRDLIMO, etc.) to LOW-
      *  VALUES on first-time-through.  Asserts that ACSTTUSO is
      *  LOW-VALUES after the perform.  Pure assignment paragraph
      *  with zero EXEC CICS verbs and no business logic.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'COACTUPC 3201-SHOW-INITIAL-VALUES blanks ACSTTUSO'
            MOVE 'X' TO ACSTTUSO OF CACTUPAO
            MOCK CALL 'DFHEI1'
