      ******************************************************************
      *  TC21 -- 3100-SCREEN-INIT initializes BMS map and current date
      *
      *  Drives 3100-SCREEN-INIT (production lines 2668-2692).
      *  Pure WS computation paragraph; MOVEs LOW-VALUES to CACTUPAO,
      *  invokes FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE, copies title/program/tranid
      *  literals to map output fields.  Asserts the static literals
      *  are populated (deterministic side effects).
