       TESTCASE 'COACTUPC 3100-SCREEN-INIT populates header lits'
            MOCK CALL 'DFHEI1'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM 3100-SCREEN-INIT THRU 3100-SCREEN-INIT-EXIT
