      *
      *  Drives 9400-GETCUSTDATA-BYCUST (production lines 3752+).
      *  Same pattern as TC26: cobol-check strips EXEC CICS READ;
      *  EVALUATE falls through; coverage gain on MOVE statements.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'COACTUPC 9400-GETCUSTDATA-BYCUST runs without abend'
            MOCK CALL 'DFHEI1'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM 9400-GETCUSTDATA-BYCUST
                THRU 9400-GETCUSTDATA-BYCUST-EXIT
            EXPECT WS-DFHEI1-UNMOCKED-CALLED TO BE 'N'
            VERIFY CALL 'DFHEI1' HAPPENED 0 TIMES

