      ******************************************************************
      *  TC42 -- 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG CDEMO-PGM-ENTER arm (default)
      *
      *  Drives 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG WHEN CDEMO-PGM-ENTER arm (line
      *  2958, the FIRST arm).  After BEFORE-EACH, both CDEMO-PGM-
      *  ENTER and ACUP-DETAILS-NOT-FETCHED are true; per EVALUATE
      *  TRUE first-match, CDEMO-PGM-ENTER fires first.  Asserts
      *  WS-INFO-MSG = PROMPT-FOR-SEARCH-KEYS literal.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'COACTUPC 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG pgm-enter arm'
            SET CDEMO-PGM-ENTER   TO TRUE
