      ******************************************************************
      *  TC43 -- 9500-STORE-FETCHED-DATA copies ACCT to ACUP-OLD
      *
      *  Drives 9500-STORE-FETCHED-DATA (production lines 3801-
      *  3884).  Pre-loads ACCOUNT-RECORD with deterministic
      *  values and CUSTOMER-RECORD ditto, performs the paragraph,
      *  asserts ACUP-OLD-* fields and CDEMO-* commarea fields are
      *  populated.  ACCT-* / CUST-* values supplied by the test
      *  author from external knowledge of the AAP fixture
      *  conventions; NOT derived from production logic.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'COACTUPC 9500-STORE-FETCHED-DATA copies records'
            MOVE 12345678901      TO ACCT-ID
            MOVE 'A'              TO ACCT-ACTIVE-STATUS
            MOVE '2020-01-15'     TO ACCT-OPEN-DATE
            MOVE 'PREMIUM   '     TO ACCT-GROUP-ID
            MOVE 123456789        TO CUST-ID
            MOVE 'JOHN'           TO CUST-FIRST-NAME
            MOVE 'DOE'            TO CUST-LAST-NAME
            MOVE 'NY'             TO CUST-ADDR-STATE-CD
            MOVE 'Y'              TO CUST-PRI-CARD-HOLDER-IND
            MOCK CALL 'DFHEI1'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM 9500-STORE-FETCHED-DATA
                THRU 9500-STORE-FETCHED-DATA-EXIT
            EXPECT ACUP-OLD-ACCT-ID TO BE 12345678901
            EXPECT ACUP-OLD-ACTIVE-STATUS TO BE 'A'
            EXPECT ACUP-OLD-OPEN-YEAR TO BE '2020'
            EXPECT ACUP-OLD-OPEN-MON  TO BE '01'
            EXPECT ACUP-OLD-OPEN-DAY  TO BE '15'
            EXPECT ACUP-OLD-GROUP-ID  TO BE 'PREMIUM   '
            EXPECT ACUP-OLD-CUST-ADDR-STATE-CD TO BE 'NY'
            EXPECT ACUP-OLD-CUST-PRI-HOLDER-IND TO BE 'Y'
            EXPECT CDEMO-ACCT-ID TO BE 12345678901
            VERIFY CALL 'DFHEI1' HAPPENED 0 TIMES

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC41 -- 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG ACUP-DETAILS-NOT-FETCHED arm
      *
      *  Drives 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG (production lines 2960-2961) WHEN
      *  ACUP-DETAILS-NOT-FETCHED arm.  After BEFORE-EACH the default
      *  ACUP-CHANGE-ACTION is LOW-VALUES (88-level matches), but
      *  CDEMO-PGM-ENTER is also default-true so the FIRST arm fires
      *  first.  We force CDEMO-PGM-REENTER so EVALUATE skips arm 1
      *  and matches arm 2.  Asserts WS-INFO-MSG = PROMPT-FOR-SEARCH-
      *  KEYS literal (88-level value on lines 468-469).
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'COACTUPC 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG details-not-fetched arm'
            SET CDEMO-PGM-REENTER     TO TRUE
            SET ACUP-DETAILS-NOT-FETCHED TO TRUE
            MOCK CALL 'DFHEI1'
                 CONTINUE
            END-MOCK
            PERFORM 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG
                THRU 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG-EXIT
            EXPECT WS-INFO-MSG TO BE 'Enter or update id of account to update '
            VERIFY CALL 'DFHEI1' HAPPENED 0 TIMES

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC42 -- 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG ACUP-CHANGES-NOT-OK arm
      *
      *  Drives 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG (lines 2964-2965) WHEN ACUP-
      *  CHANGES-NOT-OK arm.  Sets ACUP-CHANGE-ACTION='E' so the
      *  88-level ACUP-CHANGES-NOT-OK fires.  Asserts WS-INFO-MSG =
