                THRU 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG-EXIT
            EXPECT WS-INFO-MSG TO BE 'Update account details presented above. '
            VERIFY CALL 'DFHEI1' HAPPENED 0 TIMES

      ******************************************************************
      *  TC43 -- 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG ACUP-CHANGES-OKAYED-BUT-FAILED
      *
      *  Drives 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG (lines 2973-2974) WHEN ACUP-
      *  CHANGES-OKAYED-BUT-FAILED arm.  Sets ACUP-CHANGE-ACTION='F'
      *  so the 88-level ACUP-CHANGES-OKAYED-BUT-FAILED fires.
      *  Asserts WS-INFO-MSG = INFORM-FAILURE literal.
      ******************************************************************
       TESTCASE 'COACTUPC 3250-SETUP-INFOMSG okayed-but-failed arm'
